  "statement": "theorem dyadic_empiricalMean_subsequences : Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => empiricalMean dyadicObservation (4^(n + 1) - 1)) atTop (nhds ((2 : ℝ) / 3)) ∧ Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => empiricalMean dyadicObservation (2 * 4^n - 1)) atTop (nhds ((1 : ℝ) / 3))",
